{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:55 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:55 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:55 2026-11-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"啟德海灣獲大手客擲2840萬掃3伙2房 平均呎價逾22000元\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/feb8c851c65d3e056a00612134803436/2026-11/KF_Christine_80_.png\"/><p>由嘉華、會德豐地產及中國海外合作發展的啟德海灣，銷情持續，再錄大手客入市，今日（27日）獲1組內地實力買家豪擲逾2,840萬元購入3伙2房單位，計劃作長綫收租之用。</p><p>成交單位分別為2C座27至29樓L室，面積均為430方呎，屬2房間隔，合共以2,840.6萬元成交，平均呎價22,020元。</p><p>項目迄今累售1,355伙，總套現金額已超過113億元。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:03:54.686366+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":256,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:55:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:37:31.888253+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:57:25.314261+00:00","content_hash":"4fd0d387ae2bf67da25c02c033e567078dfbda7bf9405e80f8fa06a1c791f0b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}